<title>BELGIUM: Deceuninck H1 96 group net up 33 pct.</title>
<headline>Deceuninck H1 96 group net up 33 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-half 1996 earnings</p>
<p>(million Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net (excludes minorities)   186    vs   140</p>
<p>    Net current profit		    204    vs   152</p>
<p>    Cons net current cash flow	  535    vs   400</p>
<p>    Operating profit			339    vs   243</p>
<p>    Turnover				2,800    vs 2,542</p>
<p>NOTE - Deceuninck NV is a Belgian producer of PVC profiles for the building sector.  </p>
<p>The group said that the second-half outlook was fairly positive.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
